== Overview ==
The '''DJ Toilet''' is a basic toilet but with a lot more health and headphones. Its first appearance is in [[Toilet city|Toilet City]], and it appears in every map after. It usually gives 25-50 cash when killed depending on the mode. It usually has a default 1250 HP on the waves where he usually appears, thus making him a easy opponent for beginners to fight with.

=== '''Reccomended Units to Use''' ===

* '''Pick any unit when its under 10,000 HP, because in this stage, there is no anomaly heavily attacking yet, giving time to prepare. For starters, suggest using [[Sparkler Cameraman]], or any good and cheap damage dealer.'''
* '''If this enemy's HP is around 10,000 HP to 300,000 HP, comsider using stronger units, like [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]], or any unit with AoE, for crowd control. Same case goes for all the toilets.'''
*

