== Trivia ==

* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/DJ_Skibidi_Toilet DJ Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
* This is one of the few toilets to have been released since the day Toilet Tower Defense was released.
*

